# Dependencies and build artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/*.map

# Vercel / deploy local metadata
**/.vercel/

# Heavy / generated Bitrix exports (keep .md/.json analysis readable)
**/export/**/*.bpt
**/export/**/*.decoded.txt

# Local secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# OS / editor noise
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.tmp
**/*.log

# Obsidian runtime (plugins stay out of agent index; vault notes stay indexed)
Me/Me/.obsidian/plugins/
Me/Me/.obsidian/workspace.json
Me/Me/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
Me/Me/.obsidian/cache/
